Z||000000||william_thorniii||04-05-2001||12:27 PM||||Friends,<P>I came across this neat GM parts on-line site today.  I would strongly recommend it to anyone looking for original factory parts.  What is so great about it?  Well, they actually show you their inventory and prices on-line.  This is a feature that I have previously been unable to find anywhere on the net.  Not everything is correct (fiero56 found an 88 power steering pump), but it is still a head and shoulders above the rest.  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.auto-parts-for-less.com/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.auto-parts-for-less.com/index.html</A> <P>William T. Thorn, III<P>||||reg||1
