Z||000004||AusFiero||04-05-2001||07:58 PM||||Try <A HREF="http://www.usgmserviceparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.usgmserviceparts.com</A> <BR>Don't be discouraged by the Australian address. Work out your exchange rates and compare. Dave at Ponti-World (owns usgm) buys many service parts etc in bulk and has great buying power. Also has customers all over the world and has shipped back into America. Other clients are in Kuwait, South Africa, England, New Zealand, Japan and many more around the world. So he knows international shipping and on most items it isn't that much.<P>Store has pictures of all items.||||reg||1
