Z||000008||Rodrv6||04-05-2001||10:47 PM||||Well, I had a feeling it was too good to be true.  Both items I ordered are discontinued.  I e-mailed them after I placed my order to clarify that I needed a shift plate for a 5 speed with the gray dot pattern.  There was a message on my answering machine about an hour later telling me that the items are not available.  I also got an e-mail from them with the same message.  Oh, well.......<P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE, 330,000 miles and counting, 88 GT, not nearly as many miles :)||||reg||9
